  "notes": [
    "Starting cards as posted under 'Start': Ralltiir, Ralltiir Operations (posted 'Raltiir Operations'), Prepared Defenses, Imperial Arrest Order and Mobilization Points; the post then says to start Imperial Decree, Battle Plan or Oppressive Enforcement depending on the opponent, so no single starting Effect is set. Total 60 as published (the starting cards count toward it; Imperial Arrest Order and Mobilization Points are included in the 'Effects (11)' header).",
    "Posted 'Raltiir' dested Ralltiir; 'Hoth Ice Plains' and 'Hoth Wampa Cave' dested the Dark Hoth sites Hoth: Ice Plains (5th Marker) and Hoth: Wampa Cave (7th Marker); Desert, Forest and Jungle are the generic sites; Overload is the Premiere Dark interrupt.",
    "The strategy text mentions starting 'Battle Plan' (a Light card; Battle Order is already in the list); that line is advice, not a card, and was not added.",
    "The post says \"This deck won a regional. It works.\" without naming it; Josem won the [[2000 Calamari Regionals]], but this list has Death Star II cards, released after that event, so it is filed as a general deck."
  ],
  "player_note": "The post says 'This deck won a regional. It works.' (posted 30 July 2000); Josem won the 2000 Calamari Regionals. The list includes Death Star II cards (Death Star II: Docking Bay, Colonel Davod Jon), so it may differ from what was played there."
